        "locator": "title and description",
        "excerpt": "PR (cited in the notes as #22322): fix(cli): improve performance for admin export/import cmd [closed]\nWhen not using the app-in-any-namespace feature, a single cluster can contain many Argo CD instance. The performance listing apps and appset in all namespaces is simply too big and break the tenancy concept when not using app-in-any-namespace.\n\nThis PR fix the performance regression when not using apps-in-any-namespace. It will only list all namespaces when configurations for apps-in-any-namespaces are present. Otherwise, it will only list apps/appsets for the current namespace.\n\nCaused by",
